1
00:00:00,390 --> 00:00:02,990
How many Star Trek uniforms
do you have?

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,380
Just two:

3
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:07,870
(Leonard:)everyday and dress.

4
00:00:07,870 --> 00:00:09,530
(Priya:)Uh-huh.

5
00:00:09,530 --> 00:00:12,700
(Priya:)Listen, we need
to talk about something.

6
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:14,840
(Leonard:)Oh, my God, you're breaking up
with me!

7
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:17,110
(Leonard:)Why would you take me out
shopping

8
00:00:17,110 --> 00:00:19,540
(Leonard:)and then break up with me?
That is so cruel!

9
00:00:19,550 --> 00:00:22,450
(Priya:)Leonard, I'm not breaking up
with you.

10
00:00:22,450 --> 00:00:24,400
(Leonard:)Oh, okay.

11
00:00:27,690 --> 00:00:30,240
(Leonard:)So, what's up?

12
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:32,560
(Priya:)It's a little weird,

13
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:35,730
(Priya:)your ex-girlfriend hanging out
here all the time.

14
00:00:35,730 --> 00:00:36,830
(Leonard:)I know.

15
00:00:36,830 --> 00:00:38,400
(Leonard:)I usually never see
my ex-girlfriends,

16
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:40,830
(Leonard:)unless their hard drives crash.

17
00:00:40,830 --> 00:00:45,300
(Priya:)I'm just saying, how would you
feel if I was hanging out

18
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:46,670
(Priya:)with my ex-boyfriend?

19
00:00:46,670 --> 00:00:48,110
(Leonard:)Um, not great, I guess.

20
00:00:48,110 --> 00:00:49,970
(Leonard:)But Penny and I are
just friends.

21
00:00:49,980 --> 00:00:51,340
(Sheldon:)I don't care.

22
00:00:51,340 --> 00:00:53,210
(Priya:)This is a woman you have
slept with.

23
00:00:53,210 --> 00:00:54,600
(Priya:)If you want her around,

24
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:57,920
(Priya:)then I have to wonder if maybe
you're not ready to move on.

